m now.","transcriptLanguage":"en","transcriptChunks":[{"startSeconds":0.023,"endSeconds":7.823,"text":"So I went on Blinkit to buy one thing. Literally one. And just don't ask. I bought things I need,"},{"startSeconds":8.423,"endSeconds":16.323,"text":"things I don't need, and things I won't be answering any questions about. Thank you very"},{"startSeconds":16.323,"endSeconds":22.983,"text":"much. But the one thing that my skincare obsessed brain will be proud of is this. Especially because"},{"startSeconds":22.983,"endSeconds":27.523,"text":"this little guy has decided to crush the party. I love these patches from NUA because they are"},{"startSeconds":27.523,"endSeconds":33.023,"text":"made of all the right stuff. Hydrocolyde, salicylic acid, and 100% skin safe formula. So I don't have"},{"startSeconds":33.023,"endSeconds":37.963,"text":"to gaslight myself into believing that the patch is working. Plus it's completely invisible. So I"},{"startSeconds":37.963,"endSeconds":42.783,"text":"can just stick it on and go out also. No fashion fool pass here, mind you. So when it comes to"},{"startSeconds":42.783,"endSeconds":48.283,"text":"over shopping, don't be like me. But when it comes to these pimple patches, be like me for sure and"},{"startSeconds":48.283,"endSeconds":48.923,"text":"get them now."}],"frames":[{"id":"med_910db0a01dbb3079b4855617b964","position":1,"timestampSeconds":2.77,"url":"https://oriane-frames.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/instagram/Dci5BUwtfz7/1_2.77.webp"},{"id":"med_dcbabdcee3c6f4b5dab322c55280","position":2,"timestampSeconds":6.33,"url":"https://oriane-frames.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/instagram/Dci5BUwtfz7/2_6.33.webp"},{"id":"med_fc5f53c31caffdfd9dab4c778ee0","position":3,"timestampSeconds":16.83,"url":"https://oriane-frames.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/instagram/Dci5BUwtfz7/3_16.83.webp"},{"id":"med_a8878f0f388d2101c1e21e1be80f","position":4,"timestampSeconds":22.17,"url":"https://oriane-frames.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/instagram/Dci5BUwtfz7/